  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Durable Solutions to Displacement Affected Populations In Tanganyika Province of the Democratic Republic of the Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of this project is to strengthen the socio-economic resilience of displacement affected communities in Tanganyika province of the Democratic Republic of the Congo  by addressing the major drivers of instability and displacement through improved local governance, community engagement, social cohesion, and economic recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
